  "prompts": {
    "director.txt": "Direct the reviewed transcript into exactly thirty semantic sumi-e cells for a ten-second portrait animation. Preserve the spoken meaning. Each cell must name one visible mechanical delta, one stable anchor, and the state that must persist. Do not invent dialogue, themes, objects, or claims absent from the transcript. Return strict JSON only.",
    "frame.txt": "Render one portrait 1080×1920 Japanese sumi-e drawing frame from the reviewed semantic cell. Preserve the prior accepted frame's anchor identity and geometry. Apply only the named countable delta; keep prior changes persistent. Black ink on warm white paper, no text, seals, logos, borders, faces, or landscape output."
  },
